# rpmlint configuration for dictatr.
#
# rpmlint spell-checks the description and counts an unknown word as an
# error. Ours are names -- the sister project (listenr), Lemonade, a
# systemd command -- and every future release note brings more. Prose
# spelling is not a packaging standard, and a gate that fails on it
# teaches people to ignore the gate. Everything else still fails.
#
#   rpmlint -r packaging/dictatr.rpmlintrc dist/noarch/*.rpm

addFilter("spelling-error")
